        <name>Mokua Gervas</name>
        <description><![CDATA[Description: Address: 50 kenyenya<br>City: nairobi<br>State/Province: kisumu<br>Zip Code: 40211<br>Country: Kenya<br>Email: gervasmokua@yahoo.com<br>Phone: 0724907056<br>Comments: Dear our beloved spiritual parents in Christ,<br>Receive much christian greetings from Kenya Nyabioto Village to you all in Jesus name.<br>Thank you so much for your wonderful good work in your Web site which was so encouraging and inspiring to our hearts, after discussing deeply with the brethren for the last five days,also agreeing with our spirit.Since we have been revived,we are so glad and thankful to inform you that we are interested by your teachings and your doctrine in your web site Kindly brethren,involve us in your Ministry since we are working independently without good foundation ground of God's word also we request you to come and lay us a foundation and teach the congregation and the community at large.We would be more than happy to work with you hand in hand to build God's kingdom and Set the captives free and free in Jesus name.kindly, how about your suggestion?<br> Remain blessed as we hope to hear from you soon.<br> Yours in Christ<br>Brother Gervas<br>Coordinates: 36.8275452,-1.2866655,0]]></description>
        <ExtendedData>
          <Data name="Description">
            <value><![CDATA[Address: 50 kenyenya<br>City: nairobi<br>State/Province: kisumu<br>Zip Code: 40211<br>Country: Kenya<br>Email: gervasmokua@yahoo.com<br>Phone: 0724907056<br>Comments: Dear our beloved spiritual parents in Christ,<br>Receive much christian greetings from Kenya Nyabioto Village to you all in Jesus name.<br>Thank you so much for your wonderful good work in your Web site which was so encouraging and inspiring to our hearts, after discussing deeply with the brethren for the last five days,also agreeing with our spirit.Since we have been revived,we are so glad and thankful to inform you that we are interested by your teachings and your doctrine in your web site Kindly brethren,involve us in your Ministry since we are working independently without good foundation ground of God's word also we request you to come and lay us a foundation and teach the congregation and the community at large.We would be more than happy to work with you hand in hand to build God's kingdom and Set the captives free and free in Jesus name.kindly, how about your suggestion?<br> Remain blessed as we hope to hear from you soon.<br> Yours in Christ<br>Brother Gervas]]></value>
