      <Placemark>
        <name>Eric and Amanda Gregg</name>
        <description><![CDATA[Description: Address: 3227 S. Market Place Apt. E1	Bloomington IN	47403<br>Email: jayleestanger12@yahoo.com<br>Phone: (812) 345-0671<br>Comments: Looking for actual Torah keepers who still study the Brit hadasha, living under the melkizedeck priesthood, who actually pray in the spirit, and teaches we must be born according to acts 238. Seeking for true holiness and righteousness from the inside out not just outer, who is willing to actually lay their life down to preach the gospel. And not leave out any scripture or twisting it.... We do not do anything in kabbalah. So we are not apart of the hebraic roots. Messiah says a house cannot be divided, and the hebraic roots is in many doctrines. The spirit leads into all truth not many different opinions. So iso of like minded.<br>Coordinates: -86.580912,39.1322299,0]]></description>
