      <Placemark>
        <name>Denise	Sawyer</name>
        <description><![CDATA[Description: Address: Alarming Truth Ministries	10125 Commerce St Summerville	GA	30747<br>Email: denisesawyer@gmail.com<br>Phone: (423) 280-5094<br>Comments: We are a small body of like minded believers {varying in ages from families with small children to empty nesters and "elders"} who are learning to walk in obedience to the Torah together. We study the Torah portion each week together, discuss our learning, and we are a body who gives each other room to grow, freedom to have different opinions- and still love one another! We meet for live worship together with freedom in worship followed by Bible study each Saturday at the close of Shabbat - 6:00 pm. We love to have new people join us and have enjoyed connecting with others who are seekers of truth. Contact by phone or text preferred.<br>Coordinates: -85.3472957,34.4814561,0]]></description>
        <ExtendedData>
          <Data name="Description">
            <value><![CDATA[Address: Alarming Truth Ministries	10125 Commerce St Summerville	GA	30747<br>Email: denisesawyer@gmail.com<br>Phone: (423) 280-5094<br>Comments: We are a small body of like minded believers {varying in ages from families with small children to empty nesters and "elders"} who are learning to walk in obedience to the Torah together. We study the Torah portion each week together, discuss our learning, and we are a body who gives each other room to grow, freedom to have different opinions- and still love one another! We meet for live worship together with freedom in worship followed by Bible study each Saturday at the close of Shabbat - 6:00 pm. We love to have new people join us and have enjoyed connecting with others who are seekers of truth. Contact by phone or text preferred.]]></value>
          </Data>
