      <Placemark>
        <name><![CDATA[Eric & Terri Yates]]></name>
        <description><![CDATA[Description: Address: 7435 South Eastern Avenue Ste 105-515 Las Vegas NV 89123<br>Email: comp4yah@gmail.com<br>Phone:c(702) 610-3414<br>Website: Branches of Yah (youtube)<br>Comments: We are a small group we are Torah observant as best as we can while we are in Exile, we do not use any of the false names or titles for our Father or The Messiah we keep the most High's feasts and appointed times including the 7th Day Shabbat we gather together as commanded for all of the appointed times we are together reading his word loving one another and hearing what Yah has to tell us, we are not Christians but welcome all who have heard His knock and his Ruach say "come out of her my people" HalleluYah Praise YAHUAH in HaMashiaac's shem Yahusha<br>Coordinates: -115.120128,36.0556282,0]]></description>
