      <Placemark>
        <name>Living Fire Worship Ministries</name>
        <address><![CDATA[Address: 3146 Miser School Rd	Friendsville	TN	37737<br>Email: livingfire888@gmail.com<br>Phone: (865) 332-3562<br>Comments: Living Fire Worship Ministries We are a small fellowship of Torah Observing Hebrew Christians who meet on Saturday mornings at 10 am. We do not follow a strictly Messianic liturgical service, but we do incorporate some into our Sabbath Celebration. Our location is an old historic church house from the 1800s that the Lord chose to bring to us. We have been meeting here for 7 years. Comfortable but modest attire please. We are very family oriented. Currently we have no one to teach the kids classes, so children stay in service with us. Find us on Facebook for updates and changes in service times, Oneg, and special events such as Feast days and our once a month Rosh Chodesh Ladies Prayer. Website coming soon. Living Fire Worship Ministries -84.0897628,35.7761791,0]]></address>
