        <name>Kehillat Malqosh Latter Rain Fellowship</name>
        <description><![CDATA[Description: Address: Iowa, USA<br>Email: amyshute41@gmail.com<br>Website: https://www.facebook.com/groups/1394690894119559/<br>Comments: Kehillat Malqosh is a small gathering of families who believe ALL of the Bible is literally true and still applicable to our lives today. We believe Yeshua is the Messiah, Savior, and Redeemer of Israel. We believe in keeping th e seventh- day Sabbath and the biblical feast days commanded in Lev.23. We meet every Erev Shabbat (Fri. evening) at 7:00 for a meal, worship and Bible study/midrash. Come join us! All are welcome! Our eldership is Bradley Berger, Derek Preminger, and Brian Shute Please contact us by e-mail or facebook for location and additional information.<br>Coordinates: -93.097702,41.8780025,0]]></description>
