        <description><![CDATA[Description: Address: 1631 Ford Parkway St. Paul MN 55116<br>Email: bethchesedsf@gmail.com<br>Phone: 612-315-6778<br>Website: www.bethchesedsf.org<br>Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/Beth-Chesed-Sabbath-Fellowship-1636097983127882/<br>YouTube: http://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLHpGK9eayf7BaMB-FhJs4Us0iKajHoLSu<br>We meet every Sabbath from 11:30 to sunset to read all Torah, Hatorah and New Testament readings, and discuss them. <br>We read Torah, pray and sing together until Sabbath ends each week. <br>Toward the end of each Sabbath, we discuss eschatology because thats an area we know well. Please join us! <br>Coordinates: -93.1692198,44.9182158,0]]></description>
