        <ExtendedData>
          <Data name="Description">
            <value><![CDATA[Address: Hwy 35	Church Point	LA	70525<br>Email: plmrtn63@gmail.com<br>Phone: 3373841090<br>Comments: We are a small group of Messianic believers, seeking a deeper relationship with our Heavenly Father. We believe Yeshua/Jesus, is the Messiah, who came to the earth as God in the flesh, not to do away with God's Word, but to pay the price for our sin. We meet most Sabbaths (Saturday) to study the scriptures together, reading the weekly Torah portion, prayer, praise, and enjoying fellowship. Please reach out if you would like to join us or have any questions. Blessings and Shalom, Paul ]]></value>
          </Data>
          <Data name="Coordinates">
            <value>-92.2230999,30.4005557,0</value>
          </Data>
        </ExtendedData>
