      <Placemark>
        <name>Tavo and Rhianna	Lizarraga</name>
        <address><![CDATA[Address: 213 N. Peachtree Ave. Cookeville, TN<br>Email: rhiandtavo@hotmail.com<br>Phone: 9312393021<br>Comments: We are a local home fellowship made up from around 5-10 families each week. We have a wide mixture of ages that come. Our family is a family of 9. Our children are anywhere from 3-22 years old. We are in our early 40s but have others that are younger and even single adults and some in their 50s, 60s and a widow in her 70s. All that to say we are diverse in age and culture. We love fellowship, worship, prayer and gathering in the lost sheep of the House of Israel. We welcome you to come and visit!! Tavo and Rhianna	Lizarraga -85.5064426,36.1665311,0]]></address>
        <description><![CDATA[Description: Address: 213 N. Peachtree Ave. Cookeville, TN<br>Email: rhiandtavo@hotmail.com<br>Phone: 9312393021<br>Comments: We are a local home fellowship made up from around 5-10 families each week. We have a wide mixture of ages that come. Our family is a family of 9. Our children are anywhere from 3-22 years old. We are in our early 40s but have others that are younger and even single adults and some in their 50s, 60s and a widow in her 70s. All that to say we are diverse in age and culture. We love fellowship, worship, prayer and gathering in the lost sheep of the House of Israel. We welcome you to come and visit!!<br>Coordinates: -85.5064426,36.1665311,0]]></description>
