      <Placemark>
        <name>Robert Spencer</name>
        <description><![CDATA[Description: Address: 32 Market Street, Bangor, Pennsylvania<br>Email: robertspencerlmt@protonmail.com<br>Phone: 2672276603<br>Website: www.GreenLeafSTT.com<br>Comments: My wife and I have recently come into the understanding that Yeshua is King and that most of Modern Christianity is a pagan cult designed to hide God and contradict scripture. We are seeking to foster the creation of a fellowship of like-minded individuals to study scripture and learn to praise YHWH in a way that pleases HIM. If you are interested in starting a group with us, we have a commercial space to use for meetings as well as some chairs and tables to use. We are located on Route 512 (Market Street) in Bangor, PA. We really don't know where to start, as we have never celebrated the Feast Days before and want to learn as much as we can to give praise and glory to God. We have two young boys, the oldest of which, is interested in learning more about Yeshua and Scripture. Children are welcome!<br>Coordinates: -75.205505,40.8667838,0]]></description>
