        <description><![CDATA[Description: Address: Mountain Home, AR 72654<br>Email: messiahswayfellowship@gmail.com<br>Website: www.messiahswayfellowship.com<br>Comments: In the Mountain Home, Arkansas area we are a family set-apart to our Creator, our Father, the One true Elohim. We are committed to obeying His instructions as given in His Torah and taught by our Messiah, whom He sent and whose atoning blood cleanses us that we may be acceptable to Him. Our desire is for meaningful fellowship with others who are set-apart to the Father and committed to following the Messiah's Way, the Torah. We invite all believers who consider themselves to be within a reasonable commutable distance to Mountain Home, Arkansas.<br>Coordinates: -92.38597,36.31392,0]]></description>
